OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple-vehicle crash causes M25
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays after
OL,7,Fsix vehicles crashed on the M25 in
OL,8,FEssex.
OL,10,FIt happened at about 06:30 GMT on the
OL,11,Fanti-clockwise carriageway, between
OL,12,Fjunction 27 for the M11 and junction 26
OL,13,Ffor Waltham Abbey.
OL,15,FNational Highways said traffic was
OL,16,Finitially held, but two of four lanes
OL,17,Fhad since been reopened.
OL,19,FEssex Police said there had been no
OL,20,Freported injuries.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
